message: "If you use ViaForm in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ViaForm"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Soma Labs"
abstract: "ViaForm is an open source CAD and PCB design app that puts parametric 3D design and electronics in one project and links the board to the 3D model, on a shared Rust core over the SolidCraft and PCBCraft engines."
version: "0.2.0"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/soma-intelligence/ViaForm"
url: "https://github.com/soma-intelligence/ViaForm"
keywords:
